<title>HUNGARY: CESI index closes at a new high of 1,722.01 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI index closes at a new high of 1,722.01 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index firmed 0.47 percent or 8.13 points to finish at 1,722.01 points, a new record high, on Tuesday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
